bcm-ex - authors
================

bcm-ex is the extended line of BCM.

Original work
-------------

  Ilya Muravyov <encode@narod.ru>
      BCM, the compressor: the context model, the arithmetic coder, the
      stream format and the command line. Copyright (C) 2008-2021.
      Published at https://github.com/FS-make-simple/bcm under the
      Apache License, Version 2.0.

  zvezdochiot <mykaralw@yandex.ru>
      Contributions to the upstream repository.

Extended line
-------------

  Yade Wira Bravo (YadeWira) <sebasgamerelpro@gmail.com>
      bcm-ex: the portable build (src/platform.h), the command line
      additions, the safety fixes, the test suites and the release
      engineering. Copyright (C) 2026.
      https://github.com/YadeWira/bcm-ex

Third party
-----------

  Ilya Grebnov <ilya.grebnov@gmail.com>
      libsais, vendored in third_party/libsais. Apache License 2.0 with
      LLVM Exceptions. Copyright (c) 2021-2026.

If you contribute and want to be listed here, say so in the pull request.
